  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-7" contextRef="c-1">Electric transmission service within the service territory (New York) of the New York Independent System Operator at its operational direction.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
